{"channelId":"UCwoRXYg3rCnBaG4oaxZpNKw","row":["K-State Olathe",749,"Kansas State University is a three-campus system, and K-State Olathe, which officially opened on April 26, 2011, is the newest member of the family. Complementing the main campus in Manhattan and the College of Technology and Aviation in Salina, the Olathe campus is the academic research presence within the Kansas Bioscience Park, leveraging K-State's broad capabilities and its many resources on the Manhattan campus.\nMission\nK-State Olathe advances the mission of Kansas State University by integrating education, research and entrepreneurship focused on animal health, food safety and security to address the needs of a rapidly changing world.\nDescription\nThe goal of this campus is to teach students but also be a place where professionals come to continue their learning. It is home to graduate level students as they prepare for careers in the biosciences and biotechnology, and provides opportunities to work with faculty from Kansas State as well as industry scientists.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwoRXYg3rCnBaG4oaxZpNKw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwoRXYg3rCnBaG4oaxZpNKw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:43.867Z","channelId":"UCwoRXYg3rCnBaG4oaxZpNKw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"e9d172c95fb9147c4876a551c501dbe6fcb91bc8fa675675210b353965a068a5","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"2f11cec4e84854fefeaeeee519bcde72b99659aa9eca1dcc00dea4767990b4bd"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwoRXYg3rCnBaG4oaxZpNKw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":749,"raw":"749 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwoRXYg3rCnBaG4oaxZpNKw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:43.867Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinary","relevant":fa